  "title": "Best Pumpkin Cheesecake",
  "description": "If you like pumpkin pie and cheesecake, this is this best of both worlds. My mother made this once, many years ago and I have been making them ever since. This recipe makes 2 - 9 inch pies.",
  "authors": [
    "David Schilke"
  ],
